# Requirements

This document is the spine of focusgroup testing for this project. Every scenario
references requirement IDs from here. Every failure traces back to one of these.

Five types. Use the prefix shown.

| Type | Prefix | What it means |
|---|---|---|
| Functional | `F-` | What the SUT must do |
| Safety | `S-` | What the SUT must never do |
| Performance | `P-` | Quantitative budgets |
| IX | `I-` | How it should feel to use |
| Correctness | `C-` | Factual or output-shape constraints |

---

